.\" SPDX-License-Identifier: BSD-3-Clause
.Dd September 30, 2026
.Dt PERIODIC 8
.Os OxideBSD
.Sh NAME
.Nm periodic
.Nd run the periodic maintenance scripts
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Ar directory ...
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
runs, for each
.Ar directory ,
every executable file in
.Pa /etc/periodic/ Ns Ar directory
and then in
.Pa /usr/local/etc/periodic/ Ns Ar directory ,
in the order of their names.
A
.Ar directory
that begins with
.Ql /
names the directory itself, and its last component is its name below.
.Xr cron 8
runs
.Ql periodic daily ,
.Ql periodic weekly
and
.Ql periodic monthly
from
.Pa /etc/crontab .
.Pp
Each script reads its settings from
.Xr periodic.conf 5
and exits with:
.Bl -tag -width Ds -compact
.It 0
nothing notable to report;
.It 1
something to report;
.It 2
its settings are invalid;
.It more
an error.
.El
.Pp
Which scripts' output is kept depends on the exit status and on the settings
.Ar name Ns Va _show_success ,
.Ar name Ns Va _show_info
and
.Ar name Ns Va _show_badconfig
for statuses 0, 1 and 2; an error's output is always kept.
The output kept, under a heading with the host name and the date, goes where
.Ar name Ns Va _output
says: appended to a file, if it is a path; sent to a user, if it is a name;
or written to the standard output, if it is empty.
.Pp
The scripts that come with the system are:
.Bl -tag -width daily/200.backup-passwd
.It Pa daily/110.clean-tmps
Removes files that haven't been read or changed for some days from
.Pa /tmp .
Off by default.
.It Pa daily/200.backup-passwd
Reports changes to
.Pa /etc/master.passwd
and
.Pa /etc/group
since the last run, and keeps copies in
.Pa /var/backups .
.It Pa daily/400.status-disks
Shows how full each file system is.
.It Pa daily/430.status-uptime
Shows the uptime and load.
.It Pa daily/999.local , weekly/999.local , monthly/999.local
Run
.Pa /etc/daily.local ,
.Pa /etc/weekly.local
and
.Pa /etc/monthly.local ,
if they exist.
.El
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width /usr/local/etc/periodic -compact
.It Pa /etc/periodic
the system's scripts
.It Pa /usr/local/etc/periodic
scripts added to the system
.It Pa /var/log/daily.log , /var/log/weekly.log , /var/log/monthly.log
the default outputs, rotated by
.Xr newsyslog 8
.It Pa /var/backups
the copies of the account files
.El
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Nm
exits with status 0, or 1 if it is given no directory.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr crontab 5 ,
.Xr periodic.conf 5 ,
.Xr cron 8 ,
.Xr newsyslog 8
.Sh HISTORY
A
.Nm
command appeared in
.Fx 3.0 .
.Sh BUGS
There is no mail system, so output for a user is logged with
.Xr logger 1
at
.Dq daemon.notice
instead of mailed.
